{"words": [{"text": "وَمَنْ", "translation": "And who"}, {"text": "أَظْلَمُ", "translation": "(is) more unjust"}, {"text": "مِمَّنِ", "translation": "than (he) who"}, {"text": "ٱفْتَرَىٰ", "translation": "invents"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "against"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "كَذِبًا", "translation": "a lie"}, {"text": "أَوْ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "كَذَّبَ", "translation": "rejects"}, {"text": "بِـَٔايَـٰتِهِۦٓ ۗ", "translation": "His Signs"}, {"text": "إِنَّهُۥ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "يُفْلِحُ", "translation": "will be successful"}, {"text": "ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ", "translation": "the wrongdoers"}], "sahih": "And who is more unjust than one who invents about Allāh a lie or denies His verses? Indeed, the wrongdoers will not succeed."}